{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1223084545"}, "name":{"label":"Kalvinpringle"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-19T06:28:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.44.0"}, "id":{"label":"14808863912"}, "title":{"label":"Opinions on app"}, "content":{"label":"The app is really good I like it a lot it has very good accurate timing of leaving places and arriving places and accurate on where others are! Only problem is that if you want extra stuff and arrive time and leave time of more than 2 places you have to pay more. I think that’s kanda ridiculous for an app that is supposed to keep people safe you shouldn’t have to pay for features like that. I can understand for paying for other upgrades and other features but the whole point is to see where others are and if they are safe and what time they leave from point A and what time they are getting to point B and if they make it safely so making customers pay for a something like that on a safety app is definitely ridiculous should be free and unlimited to any and all places with any amount.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=384830320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
